      "text": "IS USEFUL for \n- defining layout, \n- workflow, \n- and translation of functions into interface controls.\n\n\n\nLESS USEFUL \nfor defining the basic framework of\n- what a product is\n- what it does\n- and how it should meet the broad needs of the user.",
